# Druid of the Spade only counts a token "you control": Bot2 casts Mox Pearl, Mox Sapphire and Gold Pan on turn 2, so a Treasure
# token sits on Bot2's side of the table, and Bot1's Druid (cast turn 1 from three Moxen) stays a 2/3 without trample, with
# nothing of Bot1's but nontoken permanents (CR 109.4, 604.1).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Druid of the Spade
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Gold Pan
Island x17

